sequenceDiagram
    actor Maya
    participant UX as CMP-001 Analyst Experience Portal
    participant R as CMP-004 Retrieval Service
    participant A as Authorization Filter
    participant L as Lexical Ranker
    participant S as Semantic Ranker
    participant F as Fusion/Reranker
    participant V as Citation Validator
    participant E as CMP-008 Evaluation Boundary

    Maya->>UX: Query + locally asserted principal context
    UX->>R: INT-012 Authorized Retrieval Request
    R->>A: Filter DATA-022 chunks before text scoring
    A-->>R: Authorized chunk IDs only
    par Candidate generation
        R->>L: Rank authorized chunks with BM25
        R->>S: Rank authorized chunks with latent semantic vectors
    end
    L-->>F: Ranked lexical candidates
    S-->>F: Ranked semantic candidates
    F-->>R: Fused, reranked, deduplicated candidates
    R->>V: Build and reconstruct exact line citations
    V-->>R: Citation-valid evidence
    R-->>UX: INT-014 Retrieval context
    UX-->>Maya: Ranked passages and citations
    R-->>E: INT-015 retrieval evaluation evidence
